WEBVTT

00:02:29.328 --> 00:02:31.522
It came into focus that those kids

00:02:31.522 --> 00:02:33.816
did not mean to be rude to my son.

00:02:33.816 --> 00:02:37.886
They were just influenced by the adults around them.

00:02:37.886 --> 00:02:41.355
And it wasn't about me, and it wasn't a punishment

00:02:41.355 --> 00:02:45.169
for taking the wheel and driving a few miles.

00:02:45.169 --> 00:02:48.018
It was a punishment for daring to challenge

00:02:48.018 --> 00:02:51.715
the society's rules.

00:02:51.715 --> 00:02:56.252
But my story goes beyond this moment of truth of mine.

00:02:56.252 --> 00:03:00.048
Allow me to give you a briefing